@startuml packages
title Diagramme de Packages - MavenSensorHub

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor white

' Packages principaux par module
package "com.jad.utils" as utils #E8F5E9 {
}

package "com.jad.sensordata" as sensordata #FFF9C4 {
}

package "com.jad.datamanagement" as datamanagement #E1F5FE {
}

package "com.jad.reportgeneration" as reportgeneration #F3E5F5 {
}

package "com.jad.userinterface" as userinterface #FFE0B2 {
}

package "com.jad.mastersensorhub" as main #FFCDD2 {
}

' Notes descriptives
note right of utils : Module de base\nUtilitaires communs\nAucune dépendance
note right of sensordata : Collecte de données\nCapteurs (Temperature, Humidity,\nPressure, WindSpeed)\nExpose: ISensor, SensorFactory
note right of datamanagement : Gestion des données\nTraitement et stockage\nExpose: IDataManager,\nIDataProcessor, IDataStorage
note right of reportgeneration : Génération de rapports\nFormats: CSV, Text\nExpose: IReportGenerator
note right of userinterface : Interface utilisateur\nDashboard et affichage\nExpose: IApplication
note right of main : Point d'entrée\nApplication principale\nMain class

' Dépendances (scope: provided)
sensordata ..> utils
datamanagement ..> sensordata
datamanagement ..> utils
reportgeneration ..> sensordata
reportgeneration ..> utils
userinterface ..> datamanagement
userinterface ..> sensordata

' Dépendances principales (scope: compile)
main --> utils
main --> sensordata
main --> datamanagement
main --> reportgeneration
main --> userinterface

legend bottom
Légende:
..> : Dépendance provided (disponible runtime)
--> : Dépendance compile (main-application)

Architecture modulaire Maven multi-modules
endlegend

@enduml
